      "source": "`BootstrapToken` (data): The system uses the bootstrap token for return to service with app preservation. Required when Automated Device Enrollment enables return to service for the device. If the bootstrap token isn’t present, the device performs a full erasure and a regular return to service, and can’t preserve any data for app preservation.",
