      "contextAfter": "`MDMProfileData` (data): The MDM profile that installs after erasure when using return to service. If provided, the device uses this profile directly instead of fetching it from the server. This key is required if the device’s Automated Device Enrollment profile contains the `configuration-web-url` key. The device always downloads the Automated Device Enrollment profile even when this key is present, so the supervision identity, MDM removability, and other settings still apply. However, the device doesn’t use the specified URL in the Automated Device Enrollment profile to fetch the MDM profile.",
